# Plugin: Dispatching Parallel Agents

Purpose:
  Adapt parallel agents skill for SDDRA scheduler.

Adaptation:
  Parallel execution in chain graph:
    - FE and MD can run in parallel
    - Independent tasks can run concurrently
    - Dependency graph determines parallelism

  Scheduler rules:
    - Task dependencies MUST be satisfied before execution
    - Parallel tasks MUST NOT share mutable state
    - Checkpoints after each parallel batch

Usage:
  Chain: feature (parallel section)
  Trigger: Multiple tasks ready, no dependencies between tasks

State: +
